            "accordions_JeK8VW": {
              "type": "accordions",
              "name": "t:accordions",
              "settings": {
                "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                "icon": "caret",
                "dividers": true,
                "additional_class": ""
              },
              "blocks": {
                "accordion_wVm9bk": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Livraison & délais",
                    "heading_tag": "h4",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_b36xbk": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Expédition suivie jusqu'à votre porte. Comptez généralement 2 à 3 semaines pour la recevoir. Livraison offerte en France, numéro de suivi communiqué dès l'expédition.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 100,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_b36xbk"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_FDaFgh": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Politique de retour",
                    "heading_tag": "h4",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_yarNag": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Vous disposez de 14 jours après réception pour changer d'avis. La montre doit être retournée non portée, dans son emballage d'origine. Écrivez-nous, nous vous guidons pas à pas.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 100,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_yarNag"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_9NiJU7": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Calibres & spécifications",
                    "heading_tag": "h4",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_FP3XGi": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Nos montres sont montées sur des calibres éprouvés : Seiko NH35, NH34 ou VK63, Miyota 8215, Mingzhu 2813, PT5000, DG3804 selon les références. Le calibre exact, le diamètre du boîtier et la couleur du cadran sont indiqués sur chaque fiche.</p><p>Nos cadrans ne portent aucun nom emprunté : c'est le parti pris de la Maison.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 100,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
                        "read_less_text": "Voir moins",
                        "truncate": false,
                        "truncate_length": 2,
                        "margin_top": 0,
                        "margin_bottom": 0,
                        "additional_class": ""
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text_FP3XGi"
                  ]
                },
                "accordion_ePJYyi": {
                  "type": "_accordion",
                  "settings": {
                    "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                    "heading": "Garantie 12 mois",
                    "heading_tag": "h4",
                    "heading_style": "paragraph",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none",
                    "icon_custom": "",
                    "additional_class": ""
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_nDYpUH": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "show_on_display": "desktop_and_mobile",
                        "text": "<p>Chaque garde-temps est garanti 12 mois : mouvement, couronne, aiguilles. En cas de souci, on répare ou on remplace — simplement.</p>",
                        "text_style": "paragraph",
                        "paragraph_font_size": "normal",
                        "font_weight": 400,
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "alignment_mobile": "left",
                        "show_read_more": false,
                        "read_more_length": 100,
                        "read_more_text": "Voir plus",
